Hello! It's me, Shima!

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:08.430
Wow! What an energy!

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:09.380
I'm Arisa!

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:10.800
Already! Tadah!

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:12.800
Since she's finally been accepted by Ms. Leila,

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:14.130
Shipon is very eager to learn!

00:23:14.180 --> 00:23:15.740
I'll do my best! Yeah!

