The mini Olympics with all five Foundations will be held very soon...

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:21.620
...so even we, the preparatory students, have a chance...

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:23.250
...to be a part of this one great event!

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:26.500
Oh! Let's grab the title of this Astro Bowl!

